{"2912630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SKYHELL", "steam_appid": 2912630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912630/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1761514741\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912630/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1761514741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912630/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1761514741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's hard to imagine, but what if we could step into the elevator of an old house, travel through the building's history on each floor (90s, 80s), and make it all happen again?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to collect three coins to activate the elevator. The coins are hidden in different parts of the floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must avoid killers and place cameras in the right spots to track their movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a killer finds you, there's a 99% chance you're dead, so place those cameras wisely.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912630/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1761514741\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912630/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1761514741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2